+        # Current: A=5500, B=3000, C=3000 = 11500
+        # Request: 7500 (2500/phase)
+        # Phase A: need to shed 3000. 10.0.0.4 has reducible=3000 (4000-1000) which absorbs it all.
+        # Only 1 miner changes (optimal!) — 10.0.0.4 reduced to 1000.
