+        # Request: 3000 (1000/phase)
+        # Phase A: need to shed 3000. Each miner has reducible=1000 (2000-1000). No single one can absorb 3000.
+        # Second pass: sleep smallest (2000W), remaining=1000, next miner reducible=1000 → reduce to 1000.
